Package: dicomtk.fl
Title: Federated Learning, Trusted Third-Party Custody, and Differential Privacy for 'DICOM'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Yee How", "Lau", email = "lauyeehow1986@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")))
Description: Federated learning and trusted third-party ('TTP') custody
    satellite for 'dicomtk'. Provides 'Mainzelliste' REST client integration
    with offline fallback, polymorphic encryption and pseudonymisation ('PEP')
    for cross-project unlinkability, hardened Bloom-filter privacy-preserving
    record linkage ('PPRL') with randomized response bit-flipping and
    balanced padding, (epsilon, delta)-differential privacy ('DP') federated
    statistics with a formal privacy budget accountant and minimum-cell
    k-anonymity suppression, site-package exporters for 'Flower', 'NVIDIA FLARE',
    and 'OpenFL', and cryptographic 'site_admin' outbound approval gating.
